        <h1>Bari <em>ZTL</em> map, hours and where to park</h1>
        <p class="lede">Bari has two centres that could hardly be less alike. Bari Vecchia is the old town on the headland — a dense tangle of lanes, courtyards and churches where women still make orecchiette at tables in the street — and it is the restricted zone. Behind it lies the Murat quarter, a nineteenth-century grid of wide straight streets laid out on the orders of Napoleon’s brother-in-law, which is where you can actually drive. Getting Bari right is largely a matter of knowing which of the two you are heading into.</p>
        <p class="byline">
          By <a href="/about">ZTL Italia</a>
          <span class="by-sep">·</span>
          <span>Zone data and guidance last reviewed <time datetime="2026-08-23">23 August 2026</time></span>
        </p>

